## 🚢 Publishing to npm or GitHub Packages (Optional)

If you want to automatically publish the package when a new tag is pushed, add a **publish** job:

```yaml
  publish:
    needs: build
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    if: startsWith(github.ref, 'refs/tags/v')   # only on version tags

    steps:
    - uses: actions/checkout@v4
    - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
      with:
        node-version: '18'
        registry-url: 'https://registry.npmjs.org/'
        # for GitHub Packages, use 'https://npm.pkg.github.com/'

    - run: npm ci
    - run: npm publish
      env:
        NODE_AUTH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}   # or GITHUB_TOKEN for GitHub Packages
```

